{"parse": {"title": "9TH-09", "pageid": 97007, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/9TH-08\" title=\"9TH-08\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">9TH-09</span><a href=\"/wiki/9TH-10\" title=\"9TH-10\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">9TH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">09</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.85.A8.E6.99.AF.E4.B8.AD.E5.A4.AE\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"全景中央\">全景中央</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 全景中央</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Central Tower</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>沉<span class=\"color-value\"></span>默<span class=\"color-value\"></span>而<span class=\"color-value\"></span>冷<span class=\"color-value\"></span>酷<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>理<span class=\"color-value\"></span>想<span class=\"color-value\"></span>秩<span class=\"color-value\"></span>序<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 10909</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_6_bg_qiushi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_6_bg_qiushi\"><img alt=\"2_6_bg_qiushi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/Cg-2_6_bg_qiushi.png/600px-Cg-2_6_bg_qiushi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/Cg-2_6_bg_qiushi.png/900px-Cg-2_6_bg_qiushi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/Cg-2_6_bg_qiushi.png/1200px-Cg-2_6_bg_qiushi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">加西亚：</div><div>嘿，快停手……！我是加西亚，白天在诗社中布展的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">加西亚：</div><div>我没有恶意。事实上，我带来的是友善与和解的信息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>虚构集并不在乎青年的解释，她的注意力完全停留在加西亚身旁的女性身上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>是你，奥克塔维奥！对理想家先生动手的人！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>冷静些，虚构集小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>狱卒小姐已经确认过了，那声枪响，并不是由她所造成的。开枪者另有其人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>……哼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>虚构集咬了咬唇，不甘心地后退了一步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>奥克塔维奥小姐，您深夜拜访，是有什么想要和我们说的吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>诸位，我也无法想象在科马拉会发生这种事……我从来都不支持以暴力作为维持秩序的手段。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>你们应该是第一天来到科马拉的吧？所以并不了解这座监狱的运转情况。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>来者的神情中带有不难察觉的疲惫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>无论是文学还是现实，我们都是被放逐至边陲之人。事实上，在成立新派系之前，我就已经与监狱的管理者们达成了共识。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>只要我们配合管理者的一切行动，就能获得在监狱中自由谈论文学的权利——你可能很难理解这对我们来说有多重要。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>谈论文学是世上最快乐的事情，它不应该需要什么前提条件。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>虚构集小姐，你并不明白我们的处境。只要在这座监狱里，有些规则就是永远无法逃离的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>理想家……他总以为自己是这里唯一清醒的存在，认为那篇长诗和所谓的主义能带领大家冲破“视线”的牢笼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>理想家先生他并没有错……因为本能现实主义，本身就是一个能够让我们回归创作本质的好东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>在外面，许多像我一样的青年诗人，都相信它带来的力量。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>是吗？加西亚先生，你是三个月前才进入科马拉监狱的，也是诗社中最晚到来的成员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>请你告诉我们，在监狱外，你们本能现实主义派的运动进行得如何了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一旁，沉默许久的加西亚靠在了栏杆上，发出了金属振动与摩擦的响声。<br />他的嘴唇间有一根粗糙的卷纸条正在燃烧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">加西亚：</div><div>我们曾经吸引了许多有志青年，也的确发起了数场文学运动……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">加西亚：</div><div>在核心成员离开拉丁美洲的时候，我还是个孩子，我以为那无关紧要。事实却是——我们的运动再也没有任何起色了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">加西亚：</div><div>所有人都心知肚明：属于本能现实主义者的故事，在1977年就已经宣告完结了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>不……它没有结束，至少在我这里没有。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>它依然存在着，哪怕世上只剩下我一个人在坚信它！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>奥克塔维奥并没有在意对方孩子气的发言。她知道，“坚信”有时柔弱得像一滴蜘蛛丝上的露水。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>为什么你们总喜欢说“遵循自我”？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>为什么你们总觉得在社会身份与规训下，还藏着一个独一无二的真实自我呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>恕我直言，理想家先生就是一个鲜活的例子，他在监狱中仍坚持着自己想做的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>“理想家”，哈，真是人如其名……当他摆脱瞭望塔的视线后，他只会发现自己一无所有，并且谁也不是。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>那才是真相，一个令人惊恐而叹息的真相。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>奥克塔维奥小姐，你应该不是为了说理想家先生的坏话才特地前来的吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>那不是坏话……算了。你说的不错，我是为了一件重要的事情才特地前来，而那与你们此行的目的有关。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>德洛丝女士——我听到你正在寻找她。她来自圣保罗荣军院，笔名叫“兀尔德”，对吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我很惊讶……在这座监狱中，你是第一个主动与我提起她的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>所以，奥克塔维奥小姐，你知道德洛丝女士现在在哪里吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>我确实见过她，但我并不知晓她现今在监狱的何处，也许你得直接去问监狱的管理者们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>这是德洛丝女士先前交给我的东西，我想你比我更需要它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>奥克塔维奥将随身携带的收纳册递上前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在翻开之前，她就已经转过身去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"522201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-522201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-522201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"522201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-522201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-522201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/HeadIconSmall-522201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-522201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奥克塔维奥：</div><div>我还有事情要筹备，就不奉陪各位的推理游戏了。加西亚先生，我们走吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>来访者脚步匆匆地离去了，没有人看到她藏在阴影中的表情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>调查员们半信半疑地翻开手中破旧的稿件收纳册。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div><i>“在狱医先生的告知中，我得知了科马拉监狱那令人惊骇的真相，以及一只隐藏在阴影之下的无形之手，即名为‘重塑之手’的民间组织。”</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div><i>“……他们以资助为由，实则垄断了资源的供给与分配，让整座监狱的规则洗牌，并制造了难以言喻的恐怖氛围。其中，狱医先生的默许难辞其咎。”</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div><i>“……他们举办高强度训练，令不少身体羸弱的囚犯在绝望的折磨中病重离世；他们迫使纯血神秘学家戴上面具，在疯狂的呓语中成为被奴役的对象……”</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>这一切果然与重塑之手有关联。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>我们在乌斯怀亚的城市中，无法寻找到与重塑之手有关的线索，就是因为他们一直躲藏在科马拉监狱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>而这里，正是一个日常中不可能踏足的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>重重地合上手中的稿件收纳册。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>似曾相识的签名字迹。在《UTTU》杂志的扉页里，在巴西圣保罗热情之家找到的账单上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>但是，这种送上门的线索……总让我感觉有些不安。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>司辰，是否有可能，她在故意误导我们？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>不排除这种可能，但根据字迹判断，这本手记的确是属于德洛丝女士的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>如果奥克塔维奥小姐在故意误导我们，那她一定是监狱的幕后主使……虚构集小姐，她会是你的笔友阿莱夫吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>等等……她怎么可能是我的笔友！你们没有看到她试图否定那些美好事物的极端性吗？阿莱夫绝不会如此偏颇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>阿莱夫更像是一枚镜片，一枚不光映出事物的光亮，也会同样映出其中的暗影的镜片。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>而奥克塔维奥……更像是在极端的环境下逐渐忘记了自己本来的模样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>但我不得不承认，她的确是一名作家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">虚构集：</div><div>那是一副令我感到熟悉的模样，属于拉丁美洲的、迷茫的、挣扎的青年面孔。这一路上，我见过无数张这样的面孔……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_6_bg_jianyuwaiwei.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_6_bg_jianyuwaiwei\"><img alt=\"2_6_bg_jianyuwaiwei\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-2_6_bg_jianyuwaiwei.png/600px-Cg-2_6_bg_jianyuwaiwei.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-2_6_bg_jianyuwaiwei.png/900px-Cg-2_6_bg_jianyuwaiwei.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-2_6_bg_jianyuwaiwei.png/1200px-Cg-2_6_bg_jianyuwaiwei.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>夜幕下，科马拉监狱如同一块被世界遗忘的墓碑，缓缓为冰冷的细雪所覆盖。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_6_bg_jianyu.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_6_bg_jianyu\"><img alt=\"2_6_bg_jianyu\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/Cg-2_6_bg_jianyu.png/600px-Cg-2_6_bg_jianyu.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/Cg-2_6_bg_jianyu.png/900px-Cg-2_6_bg_jianyu.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/Cg-2_6_bg_jianyu.png/1200px-Cg-2_6_bg_jianyu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在形似囚室的房间中，三位寻人的女孩分享着荒诞离奇的故事；<br />而在中央的瞭望塔前，美洲豹敲响了一扇紧闭的门扉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"522514.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-522514.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-522514.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"522514.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-522514.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-522514.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-522514.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-522514.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>呼……梅林先生，我前来汇报今日的监狱情况。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-311320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-311320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/HeadIconSmall-311320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>请进。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_6_bg_denghoushi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_6_bg_denghoushi\"><img alt=\"2_6_bg_denghoushi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/Cg-2_6_bg_denghoushi.png/600px-Cg-2_6_bg_denghoushi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/Cg-2_6_bg_denghoushi.png/900px-Cg-2_6_bg_denghoushi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/Cg-2_6_bg_denghoushi.png/1200px-Cg-2_6_bg_denghoushi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>寂静的办公室中仅有书写的唰唰声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>狱卒的拜访并未让办公桌后的男子放下手中的纸笔，他心无旁骛，仿若这个世上空无一人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>梅林先生，方才在囚犯活动场地中发生了一场暴动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>一位名叫理想家的囚犯受了重伤。据当时在他身边的囚犯描述，他因失血过多，一度停止了呼吸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>但在暴动结束后，理想家却从活动场地中消失了。这是我的失职，我搜查了一遍监狱，也没能找到他的尸体，明天我会扩大搜查的范围。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>也许理想家他，并没有死亡……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>美洲豹下意识隐瞒了癫痫发作的巴勃鲁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/HeadIconSmall-311301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/HeadIconSmall-311301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/HeadIconSmall-311301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>不需要。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>您的意思是……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/HeadIconSmall-311301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/HeadIconSmall-311301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/HeadIconSmall-311301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>是他先违反了规定，不是么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>……梅林先生，我认为，今天的暴乱已经足以证明让囚犯自主持有武器的危险性。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>我们应该限制违禁物品的使用，或者增加巡逻狱卒的数量。囚犯的自发规训是不稳定的，我们不能仅仅依靠瞭望塔的权威性去——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>狱医毫不在意地打断了她的话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/HeadIconSmall-311301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/HeadIconSmall-311301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/HeadIconSmall-311301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>这不是你该在意的范畴。你只需要做好属于“狱卒”的本职工作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/HeadIconSmall-311301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/HeadIconSmall-311301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/HeadIconSmall-311301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>继续你的汇报。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>……好的。今日有来自基金会的官方人员进入监狱参观，她们正在科马拉中寻找一位名叫德洛丝的女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>在0号通道中，基金会的来客与囚犯一同清理了监狱中的魔精。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>唰唰的书写声仍在继续，她的汇报并未得到重视。<br />狱卒深吸一口气，接下来的内容让她难以启齿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>梅林先生，我必须汇报一件事……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>我已经让奥克塔维奥小姐重新安排了监狱中的劳作与物资分配，但我们的物资很快就要消耗殆尽了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>那个名为重塑之手的民间机构，自三月起，他们就停止了提供资助……来自芝诺的军人带走了最后一批由他们送入监狱的囚犯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>为什么他们忽然撤离了乌斯怀亚？是因为他们不再需要监狱了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>自从原来的典狱长达尔杜夫先生调任之后，我留意到，官方似乎也再没有联系过科马拉了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>今天，我们也没有收到任何来自阿根廷官方政府的消息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>梅林先生，无论是药物、食品还是生活用品，再过一段时间，我们就无法维持监狱的正常运作了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>面前的男人长久地沉默着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>我们是否可以寻求基金会的帮助？今日，他们派人过来视察科马拉，是不是意味着他们对神秘学家监狱或者全景监狱理论感兴趣？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>也许，您会愿意会见来自基金会的使者……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/HeadIconSmall-311301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/HeadIconSmall-311301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/HeadIconSmall-311301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>这真是一件奇异的事情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男人终于停下了书写，抬起头来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>……您说什么，梅林先生？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>狱卒这个身份，竟然让你产生了这等的责任心。你和以前不再是一个人了。<br />“&lt;glitch&gt;狱卒&lt;/glitch&gt;”——这个名字塑造了你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>我很抱歉，梅林先生。是我僭越了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>你下去吧，我接下来还有事——对了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他忽然记起了什么，叫住了准备离开的狱卒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>记得保证&lt;glitch&gt;科马拉议会&lt;/glitch&gt;的如期举行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱卒：</div><div>请放心，我会的，梅林先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>美洲豹的身影消失在门扉后，无声息的脚步逐渐远去。<br />直至这时，神经一直紧绷的狱医才展露出该有的烦躁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>我早就说过——理想家那个家伙必须死。你得管管他，阿莱夫。你看他捅出了多大的篓子！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311321.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-311321.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311321.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311321.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-311321.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311321.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-311321.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311321.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>冷静些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>一个无耻的偷盗者，自毁的狂徒，处心积虑的疯子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>他甚至从我手中偷走了科马拉之雨。那个疯子险些毁了这一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男人愤怒地举起那颗失而复得的骰子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>幽暗的室内，它若有似无地闪烁着抚慰人心的辉光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311321.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-311321.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311321.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311321.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-311321.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311321.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-311321.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311321.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿莱夫：</div><div>这只是一颗骰子，梅林。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>你也看到他今日的举动了。虽然只有短短的一刻，他成功使用科马拉之雨改变了监狱的模样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>他的内心如此混乱，全是非理性的映射和超现实的感受，这会彻底影响我对监狱的掌控。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>阿莱夫，我已经按照你的吩咐，完成了你要求的一切，而你也必须对此付出应有的回报。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿莱夫对狱医的愤慨激昂呈现出一种全然的漠视，他一秒不停地书写着回信。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-311310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-311310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-311310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>剩下的时间不多了，我绝不能、不能再出任何的差错。我不会让任何人影响我对全景监狱的实验。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/HeadIconSmall-311301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/HeadIconSmall-311301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/HeadIconSmall-311301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">狱医：</div><div>我会证明，这条道路能通向真正的答案。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "9TH-09"}}